an and recoverable words. Preserve the current brief/intelligible minor example; hold any new threshold until the disputed recording is reviewed.\\n\\n## Execution and outcome\\nThe session is approved but no booking, attendance or outcome is recorded here. This decision does not establish a new clipping threshold and does not resolve later examples.\"}], \"open_review_flags\": [], \"governing_sources\": [\"k:audio-multimodal-instructions@1.3:6eeb0c96\", \"k:audio-multimodal-instructions@1.3:1131a168\", \"k:audio-multimodal-faq@1.1:e9bcf43a\", \"k:slack:C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790914912.000140:d54cf474\", \"k:audio-multimodal-instructions@1.3:3a08035c\"], \"declared_conflicts\": [], \"scenario_id\": \"topic:cluster_e5ea4e366efdef35/topic_1\", \"stage\": \"grounding\", \"output_schema\": {\"$defs\": {\"ActionSufficiency\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"Whether the premises that passed justify the exact proposed action (wording, conditions and scope).\", \"properties\": {\"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"SUFFICIENT\", \"INSUFFICIENT\"], \"type\": \"string\"}, \"essential_statement_ids\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"rationale\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"rationale\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"AlternativeSufficiency\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"The same sufficiency judgment for one reviewed ToT alternative (statement_id alternative:<candidate>).\", \"properties\": {\"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"SUFFICIENT\", \"INSUFFICIENT\"], \"type\": \"string\"}, \"essential_statement_ids\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"rationale\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"statement_id\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"rationale\", \"statement_id\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"DeclaredConflictCheck\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"The judge's check of one conflict the draf